  "body": "**Original comment by Paul Matthijsse (Bitbucket: [Paul Matthijsse](https://bitbucket.org/Paul Matthijsse), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHello, I don’t think that is a bug, just the way it works. You can apply the brush mask very precise, just use short strokes and the result \\(the yellow mask\\) is shown nearly realtime. Don’t try to create a big brush mask at once, just be patient! \n\nI use these masks a lot and I don’t find this little delay is very annoying…\n",
